            "0 2 4 6 8",
            "0 1 2 3 4",
            "2 4 6 8 10",
            "0 2 4 6 8 10"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "i goes up by 2 and stops before 10."
        },
        {
          "id": "c6-l1-e5",
          "type": "find_bug",
          "prompt": "This prints nothing. Which line is wrong?",
          "code": [
            "#include <stdio.h>",
