            "int main() {",
            "    int i;",
            "    for (i = 1; i > 5; i++)",
            "        printf(\"%d\\n\", i);",
            "    return 0;",
            "}"
          ],
          "answer": 4,
          "explanation": "i starts at 1, and 1 > 5 is false right away. The condition should be i <= 5."
